Sbrtlby Jotes is a name the [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Inquisition/index|Inquisition]]'s sources gave the [[Org/Iconoclasm/People/Anouk Marchal|Marchal]] twins as one of the parties hunting keystone 14 ahead of the Party. He travels with hired henchmen. His name matches no major culture on [[Færrin]], so it comes from some smaller one; [[People/Sir Arctos|Arctos]] is sure he is a devil.

Arctos was right. Sbrtlby is a [[Bestiary/Babau|babau]], a kind of demon, and he runs a drug ring out of a factory at 414 Anchor Street in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Deosil|Deosil]]. The [[Org/Iconoclasm/People/Anouk Marchal|Marchal]] twins sent word of the address to the Party at [[People/Valerius Vane|Vane]]'s manor. His hired hands were three [[Bestiary/Pusk|pusks]] and two centipede-things, [[Bestiary/Mioktan|mioktans]]. On the evening of 24 February the Party came in as the twins blew the side off the building, and killed the henchmen one by one. Sbrtlby answered with a spear that left a wound that would not close and a darkness over the fight that even eyes made for the dark could not see through. He was the last left standing, and the Party killed him too.
